    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1962940/extras/3060b4ca9023f572adcd02c755ac58cf.avif?t=1718407757\" /></div><br><br><strong>Pestilent Hunter is a roguelike shooter game with various enemies based on the black plague, with various playable characters and various bosses to face off! Create crazy builds with the various artifacts you acquire throughout the game and try not to die for the various enemies that appear with each new scenario.</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>4 playable characters with different weapons!</li></ul><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1962940/extras/97a92ddf62d6f33a0d1139cd19fd9572.avif?t=1718407757\" /></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>More than 30 artifacts with different abilities!</li></ul><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1962940/extras/9859b0754bedefc23ff7dea5ca43804f.avif?t=1718407757\" /></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>4 amazing and difficult bosses!</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A lot of enemies to kill!</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>And the craziest builds your brain can imagine!</li></ul>",
